# Purpose

Review changes to the Codex terminal UI, including rendering, input handling,
and its interaction with the app server.

# Risk Posture

## Eligible for automatic approval

- Local rendering or copy fixes with focused snapshots that show the intended
  change and preserve input behavior.

## Request human approval

- Changes to submission, cancellation, paste, or focus that alter which actions
  a user can take or what gets sent to the app server.
- Changes to thread or turn state that depend on notification ordering,
  reconnect behavior, or compatibility with older app servers.
